  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Papua New Guinea and Pacific Islands Umbrella Facility Trust Fund (PPIUF) 2021- 2031</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Bank Papua New Guinea and Pacific Islands Umbrella Facility (PPIUF) multi-donor trust fund supports broad-based, sustainable and inclusive growth in the Pacific. The mechanism enables Australia to support the World Bank&#x2019;s expansion of resources, expertise and efforts in the region. The investment maximises lending opportunities for Pacific island countries, and increases the World Bank&#x2019;s analytical, capacity building, project preparation and design, and budget support operations. The PPIUF also supports key recipient and bank-executed projects across a range of sectors and Pacific island countries such as the Community Access and Urban Services Enhancement (CAUSE) Project in Solomon Islands.</narrative>
  </description>
